 "remarks": "Move right in! This gorgeous Georgian Colonial private home is set on nearly 2.5 of flat, landscaped acres. Boarding 50 acres of protected conservation land, you will feel the privacy and serenity of this grand entrance the moment you drive up. Offering over 7200 sqft, and an additional 2100+ sqft lower level, this home combines exceptional scale, modern updates, and long-term value. Designed for entertaining and everyday living, the renovated chef's kitchen features double marble islands, double ovens, dual dishwashers, navy subway tile, and a custom coffee/wine bar, flowing into the oversized Great Room with a massive stone fireplace, full bar, and direct access to the resort style pool area. The flexible layout includes 6 bedrooms, a luxurious primary suite with private balcony and oversized walk-in closets, double office/conference spaces, library, homework zone, first floor guest suite, and a fully self contained in-law/au pair suite with private entrance, kitchen, and living area. The renovated lower level offers a gym space, wine cellar, oversized playroom with custom bunk beds. Outdoors enjoy a restored pool and spa, sports courts, playground, gazebo, fire pits, and multiple entertaining areas. Major upgrades include a new 2024 roof, updated HVAC, plumbing, electrical, and a renovated 4 car garage with smart-tech doors. Move in ready, this exceptional estate offers incredible space, infrastructure, and upside in a premier school district.",
